# The generated projection and the roadmap tables are functions of the tree,
# never hand-merged surfaces (scripts/docs-generate.mjs). Two branches that
# insert rows at the same position in one of these tables collide on bytes
# neither author wrote; this driver answers the incoming side and the local
# gate's `docs-generated-projection` step keeps a mechanically-resolved file
# honest. Arm the driver once per checkout (optional):
#   bun scripts/docs-generated-merge.mjs --install
docs/generated/** merge=docs-generated
docs/ROADMAP.md merge=docs-generated
